  "faqSectionGettingStarted": "Getting started",
  "faqSectionLogin": "Login",
  "faqSectionNavigation": "Navigation",
  "faqSectionInvoices": "Invoices",
  "faqSectionPayments": "Payments",
  "faqSectionItemsStock": "Items & stock",
  "faqSectionProfileEmployees": "Profile & employees",
  "faqSectionDashboardReports": "Dashboard & reports",
  "faqSectionSyncTroubleshooting": "Sync & troubleshooting",
  "faqNeedInternetQuestion": "Do I need internet?",
  "faqNeedInternetAnswer": "After first-time local setup, you can record invoices, items, and payments without internet. Data stays on your device. Sync with a server is optional and available from the More tab when configured.",
  "faqFirstInstallQuestion": "What happens on first install?",
  "faqFirstInstallAnswer": "You may see a short walkthrough, then Local setup (organization, company, your login email and password, currency, fiscal year). After that, sign in with the email and password you created.",
  "faqSignInCredentialsQuestion": "What do I use to sign in?",
  "faqSignInCredentialsAnswer": "Your email address and password from setup. The app keeps you signed in until you log out from More.",
  "faqLoggedOutQuestion": "Why was I logged out?",
  "faqLoggedOutAnswer": "You chose Logout, cleared app data, or the session expired. Sign in again with the same credentials.",
  "faqBottomTabsQuestion": "What do the bottom tabs do?",
  "faqBottomTabsAnswer": "Home — dashboard and overview.\nSales — sales invoices by date.\nExpenses — purchase / expense invoices.\nCenter button — Parties (customers, suppliers).\nMore — profile, reports, sync, help, logout.",
  "faqCreateInvoiceQuestion": "How do I create a sales or purchase invoice?",
  "faqCreateInvoiceAnswer": "Open Sales or Expenses, select a date on the calendar, tap the + button, add items and amounts, choose a party if needed, then save or submit.",
  "faqInvoiceDetailsQuestion": "How do I view full invoice details?",
  "faqInvoiceDetailsAnswer": "Tap any invoice in the list. Transaction details shows line items, totals, discounts, and payments. You can print, share, duplicate, or pay from there.",
  "faqZeroRateQuestion": "Rate or amount shows zero in details",
  "faqZeroRateAnswer": "This usually means line or payment data was missing in older saves. Update the app and create or settle again if needed. New entries should show correct rate and amount.",
  "faqPartialPaymentQuestion": "How do I record a partial payment?",
  "faqPartialPaymentAnswer": "Open the invoice → Transaction details → Make Payment. Enter the amount, method, and date, then Process Settlement.",
  "faqMultiplePaymentQuestion": "How does Multiple Payment work?",
  "faqMultiplePaymentAnswer": "Turn Multiple Payment ON, tap edit, and split the total across Cash, Card, QR, etc. The split total should match what the customer paid. Each method is recorded separately.",
  "faqSplitPaymentSavedQuestion": "Only one payment was saved from a split",
  "faqSplitPaymentSavedAnswer": "Update to the latest app version. Older local builds sometimes saved only the first split line. Settle again if your unpaid balance is still wrong.",
  "faqAddItemQuestion": "How do I add an item?",
  "faqAddItemAnswer": "Use Add item from sales flow or quick add. Enter name, rate, unit, purpose, and optional photo (JPEG/PNG/GIF/WebP, max 5 MB), then Create item.",
  "faqCustomUnitQuestion": "How do I add a custom unit?",
  "faqCustomUnitAnswer": "On the item form, tap Unit → Create new unit at the bottom of the list, enter the name (e.g. Litre, Box), and Create.",
  "faqStockQuantitiesQuestion": "How do I enter stock quantities?",
  "faqStockQuantitiesAnswer": "Live qty is In stock on each item. Set stock on an item to enter opening stock or a stock adjustment. Opening stock / stock reconciliation (upload or enter a count) also sets In stock when live tracking is on. Liquor prices is a pour-price list, not stock.",
  "faqProfileNameQuestion": "I changed my name but profile still shows the old name",
  "faqProfileNameAnswer": "Edit your employee record (same email as login) and save. The More tab and dashboard should update. Log out and back in only if it still looks wrong.",
  "faqRevenueDetailsQuestion": "What is Revenue Details?",
  "faqRevenueDetailsAnswer": "A monthly view with a daily trend chart, net profit, unpaid receivables, and a day-by-day sales vs purchase breakdown. Change month with the calendar or month chip.",
  "faqOtherReportsQuestion": "Where are other reports?",
  "faqOtherReportsAnswer": "Open More and look under Reports (Analytics, Profit & Loss, Statement, etc.) if your role has access.",
  "faqWhenSyncQuestion": "When should I sync?",
  "faqWhenSyncAnswer": "Only when your administrator asks you to, and when you have a stable connection. Sync sends or receives data between the device and the server.",
  "faqFabPositionQuestion": "The + button looks too high on Sales / Expenses",
  "faqFabPositionAnswer": "It sits above the bottom navigation bar. Scroll the list or update the app if the button overlaps content on your device.",
  "faqHowLogoutQuestion": "How do I log out?",
  "faqHowLogoutAnswer": "More → Logout at the bottom of the settings list.",
